# Keep the build context to sources: the target dir alone is gigabytes.
# crates/leviath-cli/agents/ must stay complete - build.rs embeds every file of
# every bundled blueprint, including their READMEs.
target/
coverage/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
# Safe only because every `include_str!("../../docs/...")` in the tree sits
# under `#[cfg(test)]` (the bundled-blueprint schema test, the config example
# test, the openapi drift test). A production `include_str!` of a docs file
# would fail the image build with a bare "No such file"; put the file in
# `crates/` or drop this line.
docs/
